  "issue": {
    "body": "Writing middleware for #660 (Too Early) and stumbled upon an error when was following Middleware documentation:\r\n\r\n`AttributeError: 'EarlyDataMiddleware' object has no attribute 'dispatch_func'`\r\n\r\nI believe that `__init__` method in documentation:\r\n\r\n```\r\nclass CustomHeaderMiddleware(BaseHTTPMiddleware):\r\n    def __init__(self, app, header_value='Example'):\r\n        self.app = app\r\n        self.header_value = header_value\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\nShould be used with super:\r\n\r\n```\r\nclass CustomHeaderMiddleware(BaseHTTPMiddleware):\r\n    def __init__(self, app, header_value='Example'):\r\n        super().__init__(app)\r\n        self.header_value = header_value\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\nI can open a Pull Request that fixes documentation.",
    "closed_at": "2019-10-24T16:12:35Z",
